{
  "_": "The technique and parameters each bundled example opens with: the shape's best construction, standing the right way up, sliced without an error. Keys are parameter names as the UI holds them; `rotate` turns y-up scans upright; per-slice keys (`thick`, `offset`, `grow`) name slice labels. Every preset names its material thickness, so one example never inherits the last one's stock.",
